  "confidence": "In 4 the distant post feet end behind a railing. In 6 plants partly conceal the outer post base. Expected manual edge reading error about 2–4 px for 6 and 3–10 px for 4. Closed/notably brighter leaves in 4 and a recessed dark leaf in 6 describe separate photographic states.",
  "interpretation": "The camera in 6 faces the wooden rectangular doorway across the colonnade. Its perpendicular return contains an arched opening. From 4 the door is visible through that opening. An independent published southwest oblique confirms the two broad treads below the platform. Joints in the arch plaster are unresolved; its visible soffit is continuous."
